    {
     "title": "🔧 Fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Career, Chapter 5: mandatory race 9 has been tuned, and the first optional race of each chapter now gives you the resources you need, so progression can no longer get stuck.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"Manager\" achievement: assigning workshop engineers now unlocks it correctly. If you already meet the condition, it unlocks the next time you start the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Perf Shop: the parts list and car stats now update right after you reassign engineers.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Racing wheels: d-pad diagonals now work.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Mouse cursor: the Windows cursor is now hidden only while the controller cursor is showing.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "MyNacon: account linking errors now stay on screen.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Pagani Huayra Roadster: the rear wing flaps move again.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Porsche 718 Cayman GT4: correct brake calipers.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Lighting: fixed rare square-shaped lighting artefacts.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Title screen: fixed a crash when no controller is connected.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Video options: the HDR calibration button is now greyed out instead of disappearing when HDR is unavailable, and the frame rate limiter slider no longer picks the wrong VSync setting.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🌍 Languages",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Translation fixes in several languages, including Polish, Korean, Japanese, Chinese and Brazilian Portuguese, for texts that showed the wrong words or were missing. The \"Refresh rate\" option is now translated too.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Car paint names now show in English in every language.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If your PC is set to a language the game doesn't support, the game now starts in a complete language instead of partly translated menus.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "💬 Tell Us How It Runs",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Let us know how the update feels in the comments, or report anything you find on our Discord:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Nacon Racing team and Eden Games",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
